    "media:imagetext": "Be in Hawai for Alta Week!\nOctober 22-29\nOver 40 special events!\nFive Hawaiian Islands present special\nprograms for Aloha Week. You'll see the\nspectacular Royal Water and Hula Pageants...\nbreathtaking Floral and International\nParades-other fascinating wonders.\nThere's exciting fun every minute...\nespecially when you go by Flying Clipper\n—there's no faster, more luxurious\nway to Hawaii.\nCover Design\nby Lillian Sader.\nOne of America's leading\nyoung artists, Miss Sader\ncombines a deft color touch\nwith a sensitive flair\nfor intricate design.\nFor Hawaii,\nshe has created\na unique tableau of\nthese famous Hawaiian attractions—\nDiamond Head\nSurfing and Canoeing at Waikiki\nNative Fisherman\nStatue of King Kamehameha\nA Hula Dancer, Palm Trees\nPineapples\nand Various Hawaiian Plants\nComplete set of menus\nsuitable for framing may be\nobtained upon request\nmenu\nVin Grenache Rosé\nFruit Cocktail, Hawaiian\nBroiled Squab Chicken Maitre d'Hotel\nPotatoes Duchess\nFrench Cut String Beans Au Beurre\nRye and Parker House Roll\nBohemian Salad\nFrench Cream Dressing\nChampagne Almaden Brut\nMarble Ice Cream, Wafers or Assorted Cheese Tray\nCoffee\nMixed Nuts\nTea\nMilk\nMints\nPAN AMERICAN WORLD AIRWAYS O\nPRNTEDNUSA",
    "media:imagetext_created": 1787954017,
